DESCRIPTION:Our Small Craft Cruises are in 20′ long Fishing Style Boats with 115 HP motors and Seating Capacity for up to 6 people, plus a boat driver. Half-Day (up to 4 hours) and Full-Day (4-8 hours) trips are available.\n \n
