SUMMARY:Printmakers Get Their Due
DESCRIPTION:This popular exhibit features work created by Indiana’s best printmakers. From modern to traditional, printmaking has a history in Brown County dating back to 1910.\nEnjoy work by the early printmakers hanging with work by today’s top practitioners, whose dazzling prints are for sale! Part of any proceeds will benefit the Brown County Art Gallery Foundation.\n
