DESCRIPTION:Let’s end our Summer Reading with a T-REXcellent outdoor foam party!  Bring your towels, swimsuits, and a dry change of clothing.  Popsicles, lemonade, and music will be provided.\n*Subject to rescheduling should the weather not cooperate.\n
