SUMMARY:Strahl Lake Hike, Brown County State Park
DESCRIPTION:Join a park naturalist for a guided hike of Trail 6 around Lake Strahl! Hear about the history of the lake, the surrounding Strahl Valley, and learn about the animals that make it their home. The section of Trail 6 around Lake Strahl is considered easy to moderate. It has some short staircases, uneven surfaces, and wet spots. The trail is less than a mile and will take about 45 minutes to complete.\n
