SUMMARY:Cask & Still Social
DESCRIPTION:Bask in the magic of an intimate evening where music, food, and drink seamlessly weave together into an extraordinary sensory experience.\nOn Friday, Aug. 21, the Bourbon & Brass Quintet will accompany a specially crafted pairing menu of small plates and sophisticated cocktails as Master Distiller Bryan Smith and hosts lead guests through the journey of our Master Distiller’s Reserve Dark Roast Rye, Hard Truth’s newest whiskey, before its official release in September.\nThis exclusive preview event offers the opportunity to mix and mingle with fellow whiskey-lovers and flavor fans, chat with Hard Truth distillers and tastemakers, and be among the first to taste and take home the much-anticipated Dark Roast Rye.\nThe Bourbon & Brass Quintet will open the evening with a short set and then play between pairing courses created by Executive Chef Kellye Berg and Executive Mixologist Kevin Goodman. Guests are welcome to move about the event space while visiting tasting stations, grazing on charcuterie, and socializing.\nWe look forward to seeing you there.\n—\nExclusive preview:\nHard Truth Master Distiller’s Reserve Dark Roast Rye\nFeaturing:\n– Live music from Bourbon & Brass Quintet\n– Remarks from Hard Truth Master Distiller Bryan Smith\n– Grazing table and tasting stations\n– Small plate and artisan cocktail pairings\n(21+ only)\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/cask-still-social/
CATEGORIES:Food &amp; Drink,Happening,Live Music,Special Events,Summer
LOCATION:418 Old State Rd 46, Nashville, IN 47448
