TRANSP:OPAQUE
SUMMARY:Before the Char
DESCRIPTION:\n\n\nWith limited tickets available for public purchase, this VIP evening promises an elevated, one-of-a-kind culinary journey set in an atmosphere of connection and celebration.Event Highlights\n\n\n\n\n\n\nExclusive VIP Access Be part of a highly limited guest list for an intimate evening with top chefs, distillers, and fellow culinary enthusiasts.\n\n\n\n\nFull Dinner & Craft Cocktails Enjoy a five-course dinner experience thoughtfully designed to showcase bold, live-fire flavors—each course expertly paired with handcrafted cocktails to complement and elevate every bite.\n\n\n\n\nGuest Chef Collaboration Renowned Memphis chef Michelle O’Guin, 2024 World Food Live Fire Champion, will lead the culinary experience with an exceptional menu, working in collaboration with Hard Truth’s Master Distiller Bryan Smith, who will bring each pairing to life through expertly crafted spirits.\n\nJoin us for a night where fire, flavor, and craftsmanship come together—an unforgettable prelude to Hard Truth’s Bourbon & BBQ Festival, and a true celebration of the people and passion behind Before the Char.\n\n\nFULL MENU BELOW\nFirst Course: Oak & Ember Carnitas\nBourbon-kissed carnitas topped with smoky fire-roasted salsa verde, tangy pickled red onions, Cotija, and cool crema.\n\n\n\nSecond Course: Grecian Flame & Four Grain\nFlame-grilled Greek chicken skewers with Mediterranean salad, tzatziki, and Hard Truth Four Grain Bourbon\nThird Course: Heartland Meets Harbor\nMidwestern fire-roasted pork belly meets coastal scallops atop a smoky Indiana corn salad, inspired by Hard Truth High Road Rye.\nFourth Course: Smokehouse Harvest\nSpicy bourbon-glazed pork loin, creamy smoked Gouda polenta, and fire-braised cinnamon apples come together in a rich celebration of smoke, spice, and orchard sweetness.\nFifth Course: Peanut Butter Bourbon Bliss\nSmooth ice cream is infused with the rich, nutty essence of peanut butter. A balanced blend of sweet, salty, and subtly smoky flavors, all heightened by the warmth of bourbon. \n\n\n\n21+ Only\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/before-the-char/
