SUMMARY:Gàdhlig! Scottish Gaelic Immersion Weekend
DESCRIPTION:We will have a Scottish Gaelic (Gàdhlig) Language Immersion Weekend from August 7 to August 9, 2026, in Brown County, Indiana! We welcome all levels of learners to join us at the Abe Martin Lodge in Brown County State Park.\nStandard registration cost is $125 (Early Bird $100 by May 31, 2026) per participant. It includes your Gàidhlig class instruction and materials for Friday through Sunday.\nRoom and board are separate and available through Brown County State Park, Abe Martin Lodge.\nUse our group code 0807CC for Abe Martin Lodge while available!\nFollow “Ticket” link or Register Here: https://forms.gle/2G6CqTxks6RYtVtG6\n
