SUMMARY:2026 Brown County Jeep Poker Run
DESCRIPTION:ATTENTION JEEPERS! The 8th Annual Brown County Jeep Poker Run is set for August 8th. This event is always a blast! Join us for the giant Jeep parade through the hills and hollars of Brown County. With fantastic stops along the way, tons of giveaways and raffles, and a great afterparty with food and a DJ, you can’t go wrong by making plans to attend this popular event! Our beneficiary this year is Do Something Brown County, an important organization that helps those and their families who are suffering from the effects of substance misuse and/or mental health crisis. Secondly, we will be collecting items at registration for Care Closet. Care Closet is an organization that helps to meet the everyday needs of students who suffer from financial hardship. Bring an item to donate to Care Closet and receive an extra raffle ticket for our annual Jeep Quilt! We will be taking in any hygiene items, non-perishable food items, clothes, shoes, and any personal items that a child might need in everyday life! Tickets for this fantastic event are just $40 per person. With the cost of your ticket, you will receive a souvenir T-shirt, a voucher for a catered meal at the afterparty, a raffle ticket for the Jeep Quilt, and one poker card. Please join us for the great event, you’ll have a great time and help those in need at the same time!\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/2026-brown-county-jeep-poker-run/
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Festivals,Food &amp; Drink,Happening,Parade,Special Events,Tournaments &amp; Games
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Jeep-Parade.jpg
