SUMMARY:Brown County Weekend Yoga Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Are you looking for a weekend dedicated to self-care?  Join Emily in the charming small town of Nashville Indiana for a weekend yoga retreat November 6-8th!  It will be a beautiful weekend with the fall leaves changing.  The retreat is located at the Cornerstone Inn for two nights right in the heart of town, everything is walkable.  The weekend will consist of yoga in the morning and evening at the Cornerstone Inn, a craft, optional activities, shopping, hiking in Brown County State Park, wine tasting, free time, whatever you desire!  Emily’s classes are designed for all levels and beginners.\nThere is a yoga retreat fee that includes a Brown County goody bag for each guest, a total of 4 yoga classes, dinner Friday evening, breakfast each morning, crafts, wine, snacks, and the rental of the community room for yoga.  Come alone or bring a friend!\n
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/brown-county-weekend-yoga-retreat/
