SUMMARY:Brown County Winery’s 40th Anniversary Celebration!
DESCRIPTION:Join us to celebrate 40 years of winemaking at Brown County Winery!  We opened with 5 wines, made over 50 wine varieties, built 2 new wineries, and provided wine for thousands to enjoy. Visit the winery in Gnaw Bone; 4520 State Road 46 E Nashville, IN 47448, on July 18!!\n\n10:30 am to 11 am – Original Wines at 1986 Prices\n11 am to 12 pm – Free Tasting for Everyone\n11 am to 3 pm – Sugar Creek BBQ Food Truck\n2 pm to 4 pm – Music from Rainwater and Gist of the Indiana Boys\n\nAll Day festivities at the Winery:\n\nWine Tasting, Glass and Bottle Sales\nWinery and Vineyard Tours\nSpecial Price for a Commemorative Glass\nSangria Cocktails\nGames and Door Prizes\nAnd More to Come!\n\nThe event is family friendly and pets are welcome outside and on a leash.  Visit https://www.browncountywinery.com/events/brown-county-winerys-40th-anniversary ( https://www.browncountywinery.com/events/brown-county-winerys-40th-anniversary )  or call the winery at 812.988.6144 for all the details.\n \n
